# 统一换行符为 LF（Windows 检出时可交由 git 自动处理）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.jar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# GitHub 语言统计：文档不计入代码语言
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-vendored
